{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1110401001:1":{"text":"曼卡拉的老朋友们，请为他们送上热烈的掌声哦！","source_cn":"曼卡拉的老朋友们，请为他们送上热烈的掌声哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E867FE7BCD7F48E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110401002:1":{"text":"这两个孩子，成功通过了魂之试炼吗？","source_cn":"这两个孩子，成功通过了魂之试炼吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDBB5B31A143B54F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110401003:1":{"text":"他们代表的新氏族叫什么来着？乌拉？乌呼？","source_cn":"他们代表的新氏族叫什么来着？乌拉？乌呼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x964F3238D387746B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110401004:1":{"text":"听到了吗， 索恩？有人在议论我们呢！","source_cn":"听到了吗， 索恩？有人在议论我们呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B56C2174D91BFA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110401005:1":{"text":"议论我们之前，就不能先把乌尔氏族的名字叫对吗？","source_cn":"议论我们之前，就不能先把乌尔氏族的名字叫对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0DCED817A5A3BED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110